      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "APP Kirrane Auctioneering are delighted to offer this stunning property nestled within a beautifully maintained residential development in the heart of Foxford, this superb two bedroom ground floor apartment presents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of County Mayo`s most picturesque and sought after locations. With the majestic River Moy quite literally on your doorstep, this property offers a unique lifestyle combining modern convenience with breathtaking natural surroundings.\n\nAccessed through a secure key coded entrance leading to a bright and well maintained communal hallway the apartment welcomes you into a spacious entrance hall. The accommodation flows effortlessly into a bright open plan kitchen, living and dining area complete with modern fitted kitchen units and appliances. Patio doors open onto a private patio area where you can relax and enjoy the peaceful riverside setting, making this an idyllic place to unwind.\n\nThe property comprises two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both finished with attractive timber flooring, along with spacious, well appointed family bathroom. Electric heating throughout ensures comfortable low maintenance living.\n\nLocation is everything and this apartment enjoys one of the finest positions in Foxford. Renowned for the world famous Foxford Woollen Mills, the town offers an excellent selection of shops, cafes, restaurants and everyday amenities, all within a leisurely stroll. Whether you are a keen angler looking to enjoy the internationally acclaimed River Moy, appreciate scenic riverside walks, or simply wish to immerse yourself in the charm and heritage of this vibrant tourist destination, this location truly offers something for everyone.\n\nPerfectly suited as a first time home, retirement property, investment opportunity or Airbnb venture, this apartment will appeal to a wide range of purchasers seeking convenience, comfort and an enviable lifestyle. It is particularly attractive for those looking to down size from the countryside while remaining within easy walking distance of all local amenities. \n\nFoxford enjoys excellent connectivity, with Ballina, Castlebar, Sligo, Galway, Athlone, Ireland West Airport and Knock Shrine, all easily accessible, making this an ideal base for both commuters and those seeking a peaceful retreat.\n\nPresented in true turnkey condition, this exceptional apartment is ready for immediate occupation and is available for viewing at your convenience. For further information or to arrange viewing please make contact with the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering - where everything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nPlease Note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy themselves by viewing the property or employ somebody to inspect the property on their behalf. No Auctioneer or Staff Member employed by APP Kirrane Auctioneering in either; Main Street, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo or Bohermore, Galway has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.\n\n"
      },
